   "body": "Fixed on a fork branch: `fix/3188-sub2api-percent` (head `0817d2e9`, on upstream `6afbe3f3`) — a `rate_limits` window marked `unit: \"percent\"` is a share, not dollars.\n\n**Root cause.** `readSub2APIKeyLimits` sets `Unit: \"USD\"` on every window, so a share-only plan's `used` of `limit: 100` read as `37.5 / 100 USD`, and `Balance` (which sums `Limit - Amount`) said `$20.00` for a key that spent no money.\n\n**Change.** exactly the contract in the issue: a `\"unit\": \"percent\"` entry becomes `Used` alone — no `Amount`/`Limit`/`Unit`, so `Count` says nothing (the way a subscription window reads) — with name, span and `reset_at` kept; `Balance`'s dollar sum moved into a `windowsLeft` helper that says `20%` for share windows and the same `$` figure as before for the rest; a window with no `unit`, `\"USD\"` or anything else reads as today; `KeyAllowance` untouched (it goes by `Used`). The issue's example reply is the test fixture byte for byte.\n\n**Verified.** Red: `go test -tags nogui ./internal/provider/ -run TestSub2APIKeySharesAreNotDollars` → `sub2api_usage_test.go:124: 5 hours = {… Used:37.5 … Amount:37.5 Limit:100 Unit:USD …}`\nGreen: `same command → `ok`; `TestReadSub2APIKeyLimits`, `TestSub2APIKeyLimitsOnItsCard` and every `TestKeyAllowance*` unchanged and green; `./internal/provider` ok in 42.9s with the pre-existing synctest test skipped` → `ok github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/provider`\n\nNo `Share` field and no GUI meter for percent windows — the contract only asks that nothing be counted, and `quotaCount` already skips a window with no `limit`.\n\nFull `go test -tags nogui ./...` over round 26's branches: 70 packages ok, 5 red (edit `TestWriteAtomicReadOnlyHardLink`, gateway's five, plugin `TestPluginSOCKSProxy`, provider's synctest fatal in `TestUnreadLoginsWriteErrorsKeepCredentials`, testenv `TestProgram`) — every one of them reproduces identically at base `6afbe3f3` in this environment (umask 0027), so none is from this change.\n\nBranch: https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/3188-sub2api-percent — no PR opened, this repo takes no external PRs; say the word if you'd rather have the patch inline here.",
